      "title": "1. You press Enter",
      "description": "**The question:** *How much did I earn on AdMob this week?*\n\nEnter submits the box (tour 04). The text goes up to the container through `onSend`."
    },
    {
      "file": "frontend/src/components/chat/chat-container.tsx",
