      "title": "6. Router: admob_reporting",
      "description": "The fast model replies `ROUTE: admob_reporting`, probably `PATH: reactive`. The browser gets a `routing` event and shows *admob / reporting* (tour 08)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/entity_loader.py",
      "line": 178,
