      },
      "title": "8. Specialist: three reporting tools",
      "description": "Tagged tools for `admob` + `reporting` are `accounts_networkReport_generate`, `accounts_mediationReport_generate` and `accounts_campaignReport_generate`. Only these are attached to the model (tour 09)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/specialist.py",
