      },
      "title": "12. Through MCP to Google",
      "description": "The cached AdMob tool server, started with your token, sends the report request to Google's AdMob API and returns the numbers (tour 10)."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/specialist.py",
      "line": 592,
