        }
      },
      "title": "13. Specialist again: the answer",
      "description": "Back in the specialist, the tool result is in the conversation. The model writes the answer, often as a Markdown table, and calls no more tools."
    },
    {
      "file": "frontend/src/components/chat/chat-container.tsx",
      "line": 429,
