      },
      "title": "14. On your screen",
      "description": "The `result` event becomes the final answer under the timeline. `done` stops the spinner, and the reply is saved with its events (tour 12)."
    },
    {
      "title": "The whole read path",
      "description": "### The whole read path\n\nEnter → `handleSendMessage` → `streamChat` → `/chat/stream` → login check → `run_graph` → router (`admob_reporting`) → entity loader → specialist (3 tools) → tool call → tool executor (no approval) → MCP → Google → specialist → `result` → screen.\n\nIf you can say this without looking, you understand the core of ADAgentAI.\n\n**Next:** *20 - Trace: a write request*. The same, with a change to your account."
    }
  ]
}
